The '''Borough of Haverhill''' is a town on the north coast of [[Fyrland]].

== Demographics ==

The population was 616,093 at the 2021 census.{{citation needed|date=June 2024}} The town grew rapidly after the harbour opened.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://townarchive.example.org/harbour |title=Harbour history |website=Town Archive}}</ref>

== Geography ==

The borough covers 297.8 square kilometres.{{cn}}

